msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Seems like we could've done a lot better. Let's put in more\r\n"
"effort next time, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Very well, then. I'll think about what I need to do to\r\n"
"improve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Good work out there tonight. I think you're getting the hang\r\n"
"of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Thank you for the vote of confidence. I'll focus on what I\r\n"
"did right and work out anything that needs improvement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Great job out there tonight. I could tell you were giving it\r\n"
"your all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Tonight was certainly a challenge, but I feel like it went\r\n"
"fairly smooth. I'll do my best to keep it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Let's work on your presentation. Makeup, hair, posture...\r\n"
"All of these things send certain signals to a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Tell me more about these... signals, Kiryu-san. I want to\r\n"
"know every detail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "All right, I think that just about covers it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Now that's certainly food for thought... I'll try that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Hmm... I honestly think you have a ways to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Oh, well excuse me for being myself... Oh, did I say that\r\n"
"out loud?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Okay, so today we're going to study a little trivia. No\r\n"
"matter what the conversation, it's always important to be\r\n"
"smart about what you say. \"Knowledge is power,\" right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Indeed. I'm curious as to what you were thinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "All right, that should be more than enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Hmm. Yeah, I could see this working. Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Hmm... I'm not quite sure you got the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Was there something I missed? Perhaps we can cover it when\r\n"
"I'm not about to go back on the floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"Right now, I'd like to give you some conversation tips to\r\n"
"help you captivate the customers. Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "That does sound good. I'll be taking mental notes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "All right, I think you've pretty much got it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Naturally. But I must say... You really know your stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Hmm... I think you could still use a little work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Wow, what a way to put it... Guess I'll redouble my efforts\r\n"
"then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"I think you should spend your downtime doing whatever you\r\n"
"like. You've definitely earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "That would be much appreciated. Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"Did you make the most of your time? You seem pretty\r\n"
"energetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "I am rested and ready to go! Firing on all pistons here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Hmm... Are you sure you're doing okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"*sigh* There is just so much drama going on right now...\r\n"
"It's hard to get it off my mind. But... I'll try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to work on your weak points. Now I know I\r\n"
"might come off a little blunt, but bear with it, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "...Now this should be good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"All right, now think about what I told you and give it your\r\n"
"full effort next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "That's the nicest anyone's ever put it. Thanks, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "(I don't think any of that really got through to her...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "...You were saying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"I think you should take some time off for yourself and relax\r\n"
"to your heart's content. Do what's good for %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "Thank you. There's a lot I've been meaning to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "So, how was your time off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Perfect, thank you for asking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "So, did you enjoy yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "I tried, but all this other stuff got in the way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to find a way to keep you motivated and\r\n"
"help you stay positive. How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "All right. I can get behind that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid "Well? How's that for positive thinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "Wow... That's a lot to unpack right there. I'm amazed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "Well? Do you feel more positive now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "What I feel like is getting back to work..."
msgstr ""

